      "name": "Senegal Tresor Public — AuditTeam ransomware with double extortion",
      "description": "Ransomware claim: AuditTeam group deployed ransomware against the Tresor Public du Senegal. Double-extortion confirmed by published data sample: approximately 1,659,735 records exfiltrated from three Oracle databases (national taxpayer registry ~960K, payroll register ~40K, public payment orders ~659K with NINEA identifiers and banking data) plus 18 months of SICA payroll files. Data exfiltrated approximately 9 days before ransomware deployment. Incident is a claim and has not been officially confirmed by the victim.",
